        "parms": "1. Click the three buttons in the second row. array.slice scale 1 4 sends positions 1 up to 4, leaving 4 out: 62 64 65. array.subarray scale 4 1 includes both ends, and reads backwards when the end comes first: 67 65 64 62. array.split scale 3 sends the first three elements out of the left outlet and the rest out of the right, right first.",
