        },
        "parms": "2. Type positions in the wrap box: array.wrap counts round the array, so 7 is 60 again, 9 is 64 and -1 is 71. array.concat scale bass sends both arrays as one list, and array.flatten bass riff bass any number of them, repeats included.",
